      "cwe_id": "CWE-89",
      "explanation": "The raster branch of getquoted() builds a SQL literal by interpolating self.ewkb directly into the query string (\"'%s'::raster\" % self.ewkb) without using parameter binding or proper quoting, allowing a maliciously crafted raster object to inject SQL.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "code",
